  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewpnjwW.png\" alt=\"横幅\" width=\"598\" height=\"118\"></p><p>添加了一个雨盾方块，可以在其周围可配置的半径内阻止降雨显示。默认情况下，这个半径为80个方块。</p><p>雨盾可以通过向其施加红石信号来禁用。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>雨盾方块的灵感来源于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-things\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Random Things</strong></a>中同名的方块，该模组使用<strong>MIT</strong>许可证。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><div>&nbsp;</div><div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KFppoR.png\" alt=\"Akliz合作伙伴\" width=\"320\" height=\"152\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fakliz.net%252fmrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要服务器？使用优惠码“mrbysco”可享受首月20%的折扣</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如有问题，欢迎加入我的Discord。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maPeNBK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/611982123435556884/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord链接\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;<strong>想支持我吗？</strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a></p>\n</div>",
